Z||000005||theogre||12-31-2000||12:50 AM||||I've played with them more since writing that post.... My opinion of them dropped even more. The ones currently being handed out don't work well if at all on most scan passes. Total piles of _____. This has to be one of the worst products of the year.<P>There are ways to convert them to other uses but the scanner performs so badly it's not worth the trouble. Do a web search on them to learn more.<P>The company's privacy policy is a joke. There's nothing at all keeping them from tieing the scanner to your personal data except the current configureation of their database. (Assuming their posted information & policy isn't a lie.) There's nothing to stop them from changing that later.||||reg||1
